{"_id":"68d3e35a166b018f83df5e7f","roadmapSlug":"html","nodeId":"93tSk4RwWfkfOyaA7I9Gn","description":"# Body Tag\n\nThe `<body>` tag in HTML defines the main content of an HTML document. It contains all the visible elements of a webpage, such as text, images, links, tables, lists, and more. Think of it as the container for everything you actually see and interact with on a website.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"body HTML Document Body element","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/body","_id":"6a71e295b0650226a59f1b2d"}],"createdAt":"2025-09-24T12:26:02.742Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-04T13:01:09.024Z","lessonPacks":[{"_id":"6a10b41ba95e0d5c68dede2f","title":"HTML Fundamentals","slug":"html","description":"Enough HTML to read, write, inspect, and understand real web pages.","lessonIds":["6a0da437a95e0d5c68ded033","6a0ef00da95e0d5c68ded162","6a0f1366a95e0d5c68ded2b4","6a0f2262a95e0d5c68ded32a","6a0f33e7a95e0d5c68ded463","6a102d2fa95e0d5c68ded758","6a106a2ba95e0d5c68deda00","6a107b29a95e0d5c68deda53"],"projectIds":["68b7185fffbff9183d772aea","68b7185fffbff9183d772aeb","6a1485bfac1c5fa9928a2087","6a1485c5ac1c5fa9928a2093","6a1485cbac1c5fa9928a2099","6a1485d1ac1c5fa9928a20a4"],"featuredImage":"","readingTime":58,"lessonCount":8,"quizCount":0,"projectCount":6}],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/html/content/93tSk4RwWfkfOyaA7I9Gn.md"}